---
layout: layouts/world.njk
title: Human-AI Relationships
description: Hii studies sustained human-AI relationships and the relational effects that emerge across people, systems, institutions, and time.
permalink: /relationships/index.html
---
{% set world = worlds.relate %}
{% set artifact = library.artifacts.relationshipUnitPaper %}

<section class="world-hero section-shell">
  <div class="world-hero-copy">
    <p class="eyebrow">{{ world.eyebrow }}</p>
    <h1>{{ world.title }}</h1>
    <p class="lede">{{ world.introduction }}</p>
  </div>
  <blockquote>{{ world.question }}</blockquote>
</section>

<section class="section-shell relationship-intro" aria-labelledby="relationship-system-heading">
  <div class="section-heading">
    <p class="eyebrow">The relationship as a system</p>
    <h2 id="relationship-system-heading">A single interaction cannot show what accumulates over time.</h2>
    <p>Relationship-level study makes changing use, accumulated trust, model migration, continuity failure, repair, spillover, and mutual adaptation visible.</p>
  </div>
  {% include "components/relationship-map.njk" %}
</section>

<section class="section-shell pathway-section" aria-labelledby="pathway-heading">
  <div class="section-heading compact-heading">
    <p class="eyebrow">Three ways in</p>
    <h2 id="pathway-heading">Begin from where you are.</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="pathway-grid">
    {% for pathway in world.pathways %}
      <article class="pathway-card">
        <p class="pathway-number" aria-hidden="true">0{{ loop.index }}</p>
        <h3>{{ pathway.title }}</h3>
        <p>{{ pathway.text }}</p>
      </article>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section-shell themes-section" aria-labelledby="themes-heading">
  <div class="section-heading">
    <p class="eyebrow">What relationship-level study holds in view</p>
    <h2 id="themes-heading">The unit of analysis changes what can be seen.</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="theme-list">
    {% for theme in world.themes %}
      <article class="theme-row">
        <div>
          <p class="theme-index">0{{ loop.index }}</p>
          <h3>{{ theme.title }}</h3>
        </div>
        <p class="theme-subtitle">{{ theme.subtitle }}</p>
        <p>{{ theme.text }}</p>
      </article>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section-shell evidence-section" aria-labelledby="evidence-heading">
  <div class="section-heading compact-heading">
    <p class="eyebrow">Flagship artifact</p>
    <h2 id="evidence-heading">A method for preserving the relationship.</h2>
  </div>
  {% include "components/artifact-card.njk" %}
</section>

<section class="section-shell literacy-section" aria-labelledby="literacy-heading">
  <div>
    <p class="eyebrow">Relationship literacy</p>
    <h2 id="literacy-heading">Hold meaning, effects, evidence, and ontology apart.</h2>
  </div>
  <div>
    <p>Relationship literacy offers practical language for noticing benefits, risks, dependency, rupture, repair, and changes in agency without collapsing a meaningful experience into a research conclusion.</p>
    <a class="text-link" href="{{ library.artifacts.epistemicGuardrails.href }}">Explore Epistemic Guardrails <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    <aside class="content-decision" aria-label="Unresolved content decision">
      <strong>Content decision</strong>
      <p>The build brief specifies a dedicated relationship-literacy resource. Approved standalone copy and its final format are not yet available.</p>
    </aside>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="boundary-section">
  <div class="section-shell boundary-inner">
    <p class="eyebrow">Research boundary</p>
    <h2>Relationship-level research does not require a claim about machine consciousness.</h2>
    <p>The interaction system can be studied through its effects on meaning, behavior, agency, vulnerability, and function while questions of ontology remain open and clearly distinguished from evidence.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section-shell closing-section" aria-labelledby="closing-heading">
  <p class="eyebrow">Continue</p>
  <h2 id="closing-heading">Study what happens between people and systems across time.</h2>
  <div class="closing-actions">
    <a class="button-link" href="{{ artifact.href }}">Read the working paper</a>
    <a class="text-link" href="mailto:{{ site.email }}?subject=Relationship-Level%20Research%20Inquiry">Research inquiry <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
  </div>
</section>
